---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
import { BASE as base } from '../utils/base';

const lastUpdated = 'August 12, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy — ${SITE.name}`}
  description={`How ${SITE.name} handles data: no accounts, no server-side storage, and what third-party services (like ads) may use cookies.`}
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6" data-focus-hide>
   <div class="glass px-6 py-8 sm:px-10 sm:py-10">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-extralight tracking-wide text-text">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-text-faint">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      {SITE.name} is designed to work entirely in your browser. This policy explains the little
      data that does exist and how it's used.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">No accounts, no server-side storage</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      There is no sign-up, login, or user account. We do not operate a backend that stores your
      audio mix, listening habits, or any personal information. All sound generation and playback
      happens locally on your device using the Web Audio API.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">Local storage</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      Your last sound mix (which sounds are on, their volumes, and your master volume) is saved
      using your browser's <code>localStorage</code>, purely so the app can restore it the next
      time you visit. This data stays on your device and is never sent to us or anyone else. You
      can clear it at any time by clearing your browser's site data for this domain.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      This site may display ads served by Google AdSense. If enabled, Google and its partners may
      use cookies or similar technologies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other
      websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
      <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" class="text-accent underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google's Ads Settings</a>.
      Learn more about how Google uses data at
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" class="text-accent underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">Analytics</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      This site currently does not run any analytics or tracking scripts. If that changes in the
      future, this policy will be updated accordingly.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">Children's privacy</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      This site is not directed at children under 13 and does not knowingly collect personal
      information from anyone.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      We may update this policy occasionally. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated
      revision date.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-light tracking-wide text-text">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
      Questions about this policy? Visit the
      <a href={`${base}contact`} class="text-accent underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2">contact page</a>.
    </p>
   </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
